From a21c53d710f7dab68722f5b41663b424672a952a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 14:53:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] a11y(ui): label icon-only action buttons in autos table
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Editar and Eliminar buttons in the autos table contain only an SVG
icon; their accessible name came solely from the `title` attribute, which
screen readers are inconsistent about announcing. Without an `aria-label`,
VoiceOver/NVDA announce them as just "button".

Add `aria-label` that includes the vehicle plate so the user knows which
vehicle each button acts on (e.g. "Editar vehículo ABC123"). The Historial
link already had an aria-label; the title attributes are kept for the
visual tooltip.
---
 src/routes/autos/+page.svelte | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/routes/autos/+page.svelte b/src/routes/autos/+page.svelte
index 518fc56..03f60ab 100644
--- a/src/routes/autos/+page.svelte
+++ b/src/routes/autos/+page.svelte
@@ -429,6 +429,7 @@
 						<button
 							class="p-2 rounded-lg text-text-secondary hover:text-primary hover:bg-primary/10 transition-colors"
 							title="Editar"
+							aria-label="Editar vehículo {a.placa}"
 							onclick={() => abrirEditar(a)}
 						>
 							<svg
@@ -449,6 +450,7 @@
 							<button
 								class="p-2 rounded-lg text-text-secondary hover:text-peligro hover:bg-peligro/10 transition-colors"
 								title="Eliminar"
+								aria-label="Eliminar vehículo {a.placa}"
 								onclick={() => (eliminarPlaca = a.placa)}
 							>
 								<svg
-- 
